  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1223837,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Dragonlance Calendar, The (1991) - Commodore Amiga\n\nStep into the world of Krynn with *The Dragonlance Calendar*, a captivating adventure game for the Commodore Amiga! This 1991 release transports you to a time of war and magic, where the forces of darkness threaten to engulf the land. As a young adventurer, you must navigate a richly detailed calendar-themed world, solving puzzles and battling monstrous creatures to uncover a sinister plot.\n\nThe game cleverly integrates the calendar mechanic – each month represents a different location and challenge, from the bustling city of Pax Nodos in January to the perilous mountains of Qualinesti in December.  Explore vibrant environments, interact with memorable characters, and collect vital clues to progress. \n\n*The Dragonlance Calendar* blends classic point-and-click adventure gameplay with a compelling narrative rooted in the beloved Dragonlance Chronicles.  Prepare for a challenging and rewarding experience filled with intricate puzzles, stunning Amiga graphics, and a truly immersive journey through the Dragonlance universe.  Can you unravel the mystery before time runs out?"
    },
